{"id":"otlichno","lemma":"отлично","pos":"adv","rank":147,"glosses":["very good, very well, excellently, perfectly","differently, in a different way"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/79/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Всё было отлично.","en":"Everything was very good.","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Ты отлично знаешь, как это произошло.","en":"You know very well how it happened.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to take place","l":"произойти"}]},{"text":"\"Как я выгляжу?\" - \"Отлично\".","en":"\"How do I look?\" \"Great.\"","words":[{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to look","l":"выглядеть"},null]},{"text":"Он отлично работает.","en":"It works perfectly.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to work","l":"работать"}]},{"text":"Я думаю, что ты отлично выглядишь.","en":"I think you look fine.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to look","l":"выглядеть"}]}]}